# WolvenKit
# This mod ships pure redscript and builds its ink programmatically, so nothing wkit
# produces is a build input. A wkit project may live here purely to EXPORT and read the
# game's own ink (widget paths, fonts, atlases) while building the injection surfaces.
# None of it is tracked; the findings are written up in docs/ink-research.md instead.
*.cpmodproj
layout.xml
.projectFiles/
packed/
source/
archive/
raw/
resources/
custom_refs.txt
custom_tweaks.txt

